{"revision":"c3c4f5f8c7642206","records":{"arc-agi":{"description":"从示例网格推断变换规则，不依赖文字指令画出目标网格。","input":"几组输入与输出网格，以及一个测试网格","output":"预测的输出网格","assessment":"网格尺寸和所有单元格的值都要正确","date_note":"原论文 v1 的日期；这一版后来正式定名为 ARC-AGI-1。","alternative_dates":[],"affil_source_url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/1911.01547v1","first_author_affil":"Google, Inc.","logo_source_url":"","protocol_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1911.01547v1","reported_family":""},"math":{"description":"求解需要精确答案的数学竞赛题；数据集也提供解题过程。","input":"数学竞赛题","output":"最终数学答案，可附解题过程","assessment":"将最终答案标准化后与参考答案比较","date_note":"arXiv 首次提交时间（v1，UTC）。","affil_source_url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2103.03874v1","first_author_affil":"UC Berkeley","logo_source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Seal_of_University_of_California,_Berkeley.svg","protocol_url":"https://github.com/hendrycks/math","reported_family":""},"gsm8k":{"description":"将文字应用题拆成几步算术运算，给出数值答案。","input":"小学数学应用题","output":"最终数值，可附计算过程","assessment":"将最终数值与参考答案比较","date_note":"arXiv 首次提交时间（v1，UTC）。","affil_source_url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2110.14168v1","first_author_affil":"","logo_source_url":"","protocol_url":"https://github.com/openai/grade-school-math","reported_family":""},"big-bench-hard":{"description":"从 BIG-bench 中选取 23 项高难度任务，考察推理能力。","input":"任务提示，带选项或要求简答","output":"最终选项或任务要求的答案","assessment":"将 23 项任务的回答与参考答案比较，计算正确率","date_note":"arXiv 首次提交时间（v1，UTC）。","affil_source_url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2210.09261v1","first_author_affil":"Stanford University","logo_source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Seal_of_Leland_Stanford_Junior_University.svg","protocol_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2210.09261v1","reported_family":""},"gpqa":{"description":"回答专家编写的科学选择题，这些题也会难住有知识但非本领域的读者。","input":"专家编写的科学题及四个选项","output":"一个选项","assessment":"对照专家提供的答案计算正确率","date_note":"arXiv 首次提交时间（v1，UTC）。","affil_source_url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2311.12022v1","first_author_affil":"New York University and Cohere","logo_source_url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:New_York_University_Seal.svg","protocol_url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2311.12022v1","reported_family":""},"olympiadbench":{"description":"解答双语竞赛题，区分可自动评分的最终答案和证明题。","input":"奥赛题，部分带图","output":"数学或物理答案；部分题要求证明","assessment":"自动评分的正确率仅涵盖非证明题的最终答案","date_note":"arXiv 首次提交时间（v1，UTC）。","affil_source_url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2402.14008v1","first_author_affil":"Dept. of Comp. Sci. & Tech., Institute for AI, Tsinghua University, Beijing, China","logo_source_url":"https://github.com/OpenBMB/OlympiadBench/blob/main/resources/title.png","protocol_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2402.14008v1","reported_family":""},"frontiermath":{"description":"求解专家原创的数学题，题目答案可自动验证。","input":"原创高等数学题","output":"数值答案或指定的数学对象","assessment":"用验证脚本检查答案或其性质","date_note":"arXiv 首次提交时间（v1，UTC）。","affil_source_url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2411.04872v1","first_author_affil":"Epoch AI","logo_source_url":"https://epoch.ai/favicon.svg","protocol_url":"https://epoch.ai/frontiermath/tiers-1-4/the-benchmark","reported_family":""},"arc-agi-2":{"description":"从成对的示例网格推断变换规则，并应用于新网格。","input":"几组输入与输出网格，以及一个测试输入","output":"预测的输出网格","assessment":"尺寸与每个单元格都要与目标网格一致","date_note":"","alternative_dates":[],"affil_source_url":"https://arcprize.org/blog/announcing-arc-agi-2-and-arc-prize-2025","first_author_affil":"","logo_source_url":"","protocol_url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2505.11831v1","reported_family":""},"arc-agi-3":{"description":"探索陌生游戏，推断目标并闯关。解题者可以写代码，但评测看的是行动效果，不是源代码。","input":"来自陌生交互环境的观测","output":"达到关卡目标的动作","assessment":"以人类动作数为基准，计算相对人类动作效率（RHAE）","date_note":"完整版于 3 月 25 日正式发布；技术报告在 3 月 24 日提交，预览版于 2025 年 7 月 17 日发布。","alternative_dates":[{"date":"2026-03-24","date_basis":"paper","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2603.24621","note":"arXiv v1 submission, not the full launch event."}],"affil_source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2603.24621","first_author_affil":"ARC Prize Foundation","logo_source_url":"","protocol_url":"https://arcprize.org/media/ARC_AGI_3_Technical_Report.pdf","reported_family":""},"gamebench":{"description":"玩游戏：模型在桌游、纸牌和社交推理游戏中与对手过招。看的是出招和对局结果，不要求模型制作游戏。","input":"游戏规则和当前局面；多数用文本，Hive 可使用图像","output":"当前回合的一步行动","assessment":"依据两两对战的结果，用 Bradley–Terry 模型估计相对实力。","date_note":"首篇公开论文。大多数游戏用文字描述局面，Hive 还使用图像观测。","affil_source_url":"","first_author_affil":"","logo_source_url":"","protocol_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2406.06613","reported_family":""},"arc-agi-3-preview":{"description":"探索早期交互式游戏集，推断游戏规则。该开发者预览及配套竞赛有别于 2026 年的完整评测。","input":"预览版游戏中的网格观测","output":"一系列符合游戏规则的动作","assessment":"预览竞赛按留出游戏的通关数排名，同分另行比较；这不是 2026 完整版的 RHAE 分数","date_note":"维护者回顾中明确记载，公开预览为 7 月 17 日，竞赛于 7 月 18 日开始。","alternative_dates":[],"affil_source_url":"","first_author_affil":"","logo_source_url":"","protocol_url":"https://arcprize.org/competitions/arc-agi-3-preview-agents/archive","reported_family":""},"reasoning-arena":{"description":"回答一组数学、逻辑及多步推理题。","input":"一道评测题","output":"模型给出的候选答案","assessment":"逐题评分，并报告分数、时间和成本；有一篇同名的推理轨迹锦标赛训练论文，两者不同","date_note":"","affil_source_url":"","first_author_affil":"","logo_source_url":"","protocol_url":"https://github.com/andrewbondman/reasoning-arena"},"mm-arena":{"description":"在规则明确的做市游戏中报价；此处 MM 指做市（market making）。","input":"市场说明及成交观测","output":"买入和卖出报价","assessment":"以贝叶斯参考报价策略为基准，比较预期交易表现","date_note":"","affil_source_url":"","first_author_affil":"","logo_source_url":"","protocol_url":"https://github.com/h-a-forster/mm-arena"},"game-arena":{"description":"玩游戏，不是做游戏：Kaggle Game Arena 让模型在国际象棋、扑克和狼人杀中互相对战，按各自项目的对局结果排名。","input":"已公开文本协议中的游戏规则、可观察局面或历史记录","output":"按游戏规则走子、下注或进行对话行动","assessment":"依各游戏的计分协议，通过模型之间的直接对局比较实力。","date_note":"","affil_source_url":"","first_author_affil":"","logo_source_url":"","protocol_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.31473"},"ref-ai2-reasoning-challenge":{"description":"AI2 的 ARC 推理挑战，以问答考察推理能力。","date_note":"","affil_source_url":"","first_author_affil":"","logo_source_url":"","protocol_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/1803.05457v1","source_title":"Think you have Solved Question Answering? Try ARC, the AI2 Reaso